              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Beyond? (ultrā.) On this side? (citrā.) At the house of? (apud.) Face to face? (cōram.) By which way? (quā.) At the same time? (simul.) Perhaps? (fortasse.) Also? (quoque.) As if? (quasi.) Because of? (propter.) Rough? (asper, aspera, asperum.) Deep? (profundus, profunda, profundum.) Unknown? (ignōtus, ignōta, ignōtum.) Necessary? (necessārius, necessāria, necessārium.) Useless? (inūtilis, inūtile.) Industrious? (industrius, industria, industrium.) Talkative? (loquāx, loquācis.) Worried? (sollicitus, sollicita, sollicitum.) Unmarried? (caelebs, caelibis.) Rainy? (pluvius, pluvia, pluvium.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
